{"pageProps":{"source":"Un jardin numérique (en anglais : digital garden) est un espace en ligne qui se trouve à l'intersection d'un carnet de notes et d'un blog, où des graines de pensées sont partagés et cultivés en public.\n\n<blockquote class=\"callout quote\"><div class=\"callout-title\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.756-2.017-2-2H4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2 1 0 1 0 1 1v1c0 1-1 2-2 2s-1 .008-1 1.031V20c0 1 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M15 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.757-2.017-2-2h-4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2h.75c0 2.25.25 4-2.75 4v3c0 1 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Joel Hooks</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\"><p>The phrase \"digital garden\" is a metaphor for thinking about writing and creating that focuses less on the resulting \"showpiece\" and more on the process, care, and craft it takes to get there.</p></div></blockquote>\n\n***\n\nRéférences :\n\n*   <https://joelhooks.com/digital-garden>\n*   <https://tomcritchlow.com/2019/02/17/building-digital-garden/>\n*   <https://technologyreview.com/2020/09/03/1007716/digital-gardens-let-you-cultivate-your-own-little-bit-of-the-internet/>\n*   <https://maggieappleton.com/garden-history>\n*   <https://nesslabs.com/digital-garden-set-up>\n*   Michael Simmons - Digital Garden Mastery Manual\n","isIndex":false,"file":"Digital Garden.md","fileName":"Digital Garden","title":"Digital Garden","comments":true,"permalink":"digital-garden","datePublished":"2021-06-27T19:19","dateUpdated":"2021-06-27T19:19","publish":true,"rss":true,"aliases":"[Jardin numérique]","links":"[[PKM]]"},"__N_SSG":true}